    "summary": "Lep Seclusa is a group dungeon hidden on an island in the bay of Hew's Bane. It is included in the Fallen Banners DLC alongside Exiled Redoubt. The entrance is located at a boat in the middle of Abah's Landing docks in Hew's Bane. Centipedes, fleshflies, hermit crabs, herons, rats, scorpions, snakes and torchbugs are found in numbers within.",
